<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADR STARTS UP AT $84-1/8, GAINS MORE.</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADR STARTS UP AT $84-1/8, GAINS MORE.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia Oy's A share ADR opened $0-3/16 up at $84-1/8 in New York on Thursday and soon gained further to $84-3/16.</p>
<p>The latter price corresponded to about 465.07 markka.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
